HW: Guessing game

repeat
Generate a random number between 1 and 100
The user gets 7 attempts

Set user guessed correctly to false
Have a counter for attempts starting at seven
Ask the user to guess the number
Get the user's guess

If the number is guessed wrong, subtract 1 from the counter
  If the guessed number is higher than the number chosen, print the hint "Too high" 
  else the guessed number is lower than the number chosen, print the hint "Too low" 
  else, if the guessed number is closer to the number, print "Closer"
end if

If the user guesses correctly, print "You win!!"
Set user guessed correctly to true

If the user runs out of attempts, print "You lose"

Print asking the user, "Do you want to play again?"
Prompt "Y/N"
Get the user's choice

until users choice is "N"

Print "thanks for playing" if N is selected



